|game_text=Plays on table. While you have 14 or fewer cards in hand, opponent may not remove cards from your hand. Once per turn (even at start of turn), may suspend a [Coruscant] Political Effect for remainder of turn. If Grimtaash just played, may place a card from hand in Used Pile.
|errata_history=This is version PC-E2 (3 of 3), 22 July 2024. It is the current text. The image is the PC card image of this version.
* '''Original''' ([[Vote Of No Confidence]]): PC card image of 8 July 2018<ref name="ht-D_voteofnoconfidence-0">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/022435b/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Dark/large/voteofnoconfidence.gif voteofnoconfidence.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/022435b 022435b] (8 July 2018, “Set 9 load”).</ref>, no errata mark; lower-left name “•Little Real Power”. The PC first released this shield with [[Virtual Set 0]] / [[Virtual Set D]] on 24 September 2014. The PC's Holotable image set starts on 8 July 2018, so this is the earliest surviving PC card image; whether the 2014 release slip had the same words is not shown by it. Text: “Plays on table. While you have 12 or fewer cards in hand, opponent may not remove cards from your hand (except with Grimtaash). Once per turn (even at start of turn), target a [Coruscant] Political Effect; it is suspended for the remainder of the turn.”
* '''PC-E1''' ([[Vote Of No Confidence (Errata)]]): PC card image of 5 March 2022<ref name="ht-D_voteofnoconfidence-1">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/79618fb/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Dark/large/voteofnoconfidence.gif voteofnoconfidence.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/79618fb 79618fb] (5 March 2022, “Fixing case and making gifs”); high-resolution image <code>ResetDS-Dark/hires/voteofnoconfidence.png</code>, commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/d23ce93 d23ce93] (4 March 2022, “January 2022 Errata images.”).</ref>, marked “E1”; lower-left name “Little Real Power”. What changed from the previous version: PC errata of January 2022 (the high-resolution image was committed on 4 March 2022 as “January 2022 Errata images.”; image marked “E1”): “target a [Coruscant] Political Effect” becomes “may target a [Coruscant] Political Effect”. The bullet is dropped from the lower-left name, and the image is re-made at a larger size. The PC published a pixel-identical copy of this image on 5 July 2022 (“fixing sizes”; file format change only, no visible change). Text: “Plays on table. While you have 12 or fewer cards in hand, opponent may not remove cards from your hand (except with Grimtaash). Once per turn (even at start of turn), may target a [Coruscant] Political Effect; it is suspended for the remainder of the turn.”
* '''PC-E2''' (this page): PC card image of 22 July 2024<ref name="ht-D_voteofnoconfidence-2">PC card image in the PC's Holotable image set: [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/blob/6c22b09/Images-HT/starwars/ResetDS-Dark/large/voteofnoconfidence.gif voteofnoconfidence.gif], commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/6c22b09 6c22b09] (22 July 2024, “Fixing case and making gifs”); high-resolution image <code>ResetDS-Dark/hires/voteofnoconfidence.png</code>, commit [https://github.com/swccgpc/holotable/commit/a546b30 a546b30] (21 July 2024, “Set 23 Errata”).</ref>, marked “E2”; lower-left name “Little Real Power”. What changed from the previous version: PC errata released with [[Virtual Set 23]] and the July 2024 Defensive Shield Update Kit<ref name="dskit2024">Players Committee, [https://res.starwarsccg.org/virtual/DShieldUpdateKit_2024_July.pdf July 2024 Defensive Shield Update Kit] (PDF, 3 pages, “SWCCG Players Committee, July 2024”; file built 2 August 2024), released with [[Virtual Set 23]] (22 July 2024).</ref> (image marked “E2”): “12 or fewer” becomes “14 or fewer”; “(except with Grimtaash)” is removed; “may target a [Coruscant] Political Effect; it is suspended for the remainder of the turn” becomes “may suspend a [Coruscant] Political Effect for remainder of turn”; new last sentence “If Grimtaash just played, may place a card from hand in Used Pile.” Text: “Plays on table. While you have 14 or fewer cards in hand, opponent may not remove cards from your hand. Once per turn (even at start of turn), may suspend a [Coruscant] Political Effect for remainder of turn. If Grimtaash just played, may place a card from hand in Used Pile.”
Versions follow Bill's rulings of 12 November 2026: every visible change on a PC card image is a version, numbered in release order; a printed errata mark that does not match that order is recorded as a PC transcription error.

